{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:InformationTheory.VdwPskewIsolation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"InformationTheory.VdwPskewIsolation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VdwPskew.vdw_is_bar_odd_residual","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VdwPskew.vdw_is_bar_odd_residual","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/vdw-pskew-isolation.lean#L62-L71","doc":"The bar-odd (van der Waals) part isolated: on the idempotents with\n`a + b = 1`, the whole bar-even contribution is `barEven q qi · 1` and the\nremainder is exactly `barOdd q qi · (a − b)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VdwPskew.hopf_bar_even_odd_decomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VdwPskew.hopf_bar_even_odd_decomposition","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/vdw-pskew-isolation.lean#L47-L60","doc":"**van der Waals = the bar-odd channel.** The Hopf weighting `q²·a + qi²·b`\nsplits into a bar-even part on `a+b` and a bar-odd part on `a−b`:\n\n  `2·(q²·a + qi²·b) = (q²+qi²)·(a+b) + (q²−qi²)·(a−b)`.\n\nFor the idempotents (`a = e₊`, `b = e₋`, `a+b = 1`) the bar-even part is the\nretained `cosh(2λ)·𝟙` carrier and the bar-odd part is `sinh(2λ)·(e₊−e₋)` —\nthe discarded P_skew / van der Waals channel. Pure-`ring`, sorry-free. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:vdw-pskew-isolation","label":"prop:vdw-pskew-isolation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/vdw-pskew-isolation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VdwPskew.barOdd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VdwPskew.barOdd","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/vdw-pskew-isolation.lean#L44-L45","doc":"Bar-odd coefficient `q² − qi²` (`= 2sinh 2λ`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VdwPskew.barEven","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VdwPskew.barEven","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/vdw-pskew-isolation.lean#L41-L42","doc":"Bar-even coefficient `q² + qi²` (`= 2cosh 2λ`, `λ = ln q`, `qi = q⁻¹`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}